      "m_displayImage1": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Salutations, Wizard. I trust Librarian Fitzhume delivered my note? Excellent. Then you are aware of the work Captain Pork and I have been doing.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "As for the subject the note posited to you: What is the status of young Mellori?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Hmm, so there is much work yet to be done. However, it would not be prudent for me to abandon my current project so close to its completion.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Sensors we've installed throughout Empyrea have yielded fascinating results. I believe we're on the cusp of a communications breakthrough.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "However, this Sensor has been damaged, compromising the integrity of the entire Network. Thankfully, I have identified the cause of the problem:",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Lightning Bugs have looted the Dynamos from this Sensor. I theorize the intense electricity the Dynamos generate is comforting to them.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Network is vital to our efforts here in Empyrea and must be repaired. Can you please retrieve the pilfered Dynamos from the Lightning Bugs?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_07.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ah good, you have retrieved the Dynamos. I will replace them and recalibrate the Sensor now.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_08.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Done. With the Network back online, I should now be able to remotely hail Captain Pork at basecamp via my Communicator Badge...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_09.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "*Static* Sparck to Pork. Come in Captain Pork. *Static* Captain Pork, do you read me? *Static*",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_10.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Communicators are, indeed, working. And believe it or not, we have the severing of the Fire and Ice Paradox Chain to thank for it.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_11.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You see, my Sensors have serendipitously collected data which shows a dramatic reduction in the Aethyr in the air. Most notably, around Athanor.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_12.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The decrease in atmospheric animositrons confirms the Aethyr is the physical residue of the ancient clash between Raven and Spider.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_13.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Paradox Chains appear to attract the Aethyr, and even bolster its volatile, violent nature.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_14.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "That negative energy is what keeps Raven and Spider away from Empyrea. Ergo, breaking the Paradox Chains is bad in that respect.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_15.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Conversely, the diminished Aethyr has greatly simplified travel and, as you just witnessed, created fascinating communications capabilities.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_16.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I've programmed our Crew Badges to function as Communicators. I took the liberty of fashioning you one as well. You are most welcome.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_17.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-JUNG-NPC10_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Now, there are a few security updates I must make to this Sensor. If you need me, you know how to find me. Please brief Pork on my status.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_18.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1452056,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
